					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-312257#post-3781024</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-312257/scp-917#post-3781024</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 26 Apr 2018 02:21:26 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Cliff Mariachi</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3695320</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Well, there are two types of eclipses.<br /> A solar eclipse is one possibility, in which the moon temporarily passes in between the sun and the earth, blocking the light of the sun partially or totally.</p> <p>A lunar eclipse is another variant of an eclipse in which the earth blocks the light to the moon. A lunar eclipse is sometimes referred to as a blood moon.</p> <p>And that is what happens during an eclipse.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
